{
 "about": "A fake rust-analyzer (the scripted server the sources ship) is put first on PATH: opening src/lib.rs in the Code layout starts it, its warning is a squiggle under x with a Fix button when the pointer rests there, the hover card holds the server's answer with Go to definition and Find references, an inlay hint shows, and Language servers lists the server and the problem. The debugger half is crates/app/tests/journeys.rs.",
 "empty": true,
 "project": {
  "src/lib.rs": "// the library\npub fn add(first: i32,   x: i32) -> i32 {\n    first + x\n}\n"
 },
